      <h2>Accelerate development with CommerceForge CLI 3.0</h2>
      <p>Initialize new apps, themes, and headless storefronts in an instant with the latest CommerceForge CLI. A single command installs all the dependencies you need, including the CLI itself, so you can dive straight into development.</p>
